# n2p2 standard Kalman filter on the pyamff force-trained squared error.
# energy coefficient 1.0, force coefficient 0.1.
# One force call is one combined loss-gradient evaluation.
# Each epoch updates every structure and 3.0 force components per structure.
# Force observations use force_weight 1.0.
# Structure and component order is n2p2 std::shuffle with random_seed 1234567.
# The property schedule uses the one-process rngGlobalNew stream.
# Weights are the harness uniform[-1, 1) draw.
# loss commit 8037eb98e2288c132c112aa6c2032f00cd5c5277. gradient tolerance 0.1.
n 50
nfailed 50
cap 30000
counter harness
code n2p2
code_version 2.3.0
commit 29b9c9f10b1ac9ea45631b3d556a129ca3b701c2
algorithm Kalman
template n2p2/c2h4-kalman-force
problem mlopt/C2H4
tuning force
par2_mean 60000.0
median 60000.0
median_low 60000.0
median_high 60000.0
wilson_low 0.0
wilson_high 0.07134759913335872
n_cap 50
n_divergence 0
n_crash 0
n_wrong_stationary 0
